    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Scavenger's Guide to Droids\">Star Wars Saga Edition Scavenger's Guide to Droids</a></i></p><p>Using an integrated system of gyroscopes, hydraulics, and high-speed processing, this system gives a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Droid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Droid\">Droid</a> greater stability. The <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Droid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Droid\">Droid</a> gains a +5 stability bonus to checks and <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Defenses\" title=\"Defenses\">Defenses</a> to resist attempts to knock it <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Prone\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Prone\">Prone</a>. This bonus stacks with the bonus provided by the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Extra_Legs\" title=\"Extra Legs\">Extra Legs</a> Locomotion System.</p>",
